            "sid": "ROM 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana ligongo cici? Ligongo lyakuti jemanjajo ŵasakaga kuti asimanikwe kuti ali ŵakulungama pameso pa Mlungu, ngaŵaga kupitila mu cikulupi ciŵakwete nambo pa yitendo yawo. Jemanjajo ŵakuŵele pa liganga lyakwakuŵasya ŵandu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
